.TH DANBY-MULTISTAGEROCKET 1
.SH NAME
danby-multistagerocket \- sequential two-stage rocket dynamics
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B danby/multistagerocket
.SH MODEL
The first stage burns and is discarded before the second stage ignites. The
mass discontinuity and separate thrust levels expose the performance reason for
staging while gravity and drag remain active.
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/danby/plugin/multistagerocket.b
